      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "We included observational studies of any type (case series, cohort studies, case-control studies). Case reports were also considered eligible for inclusion in this SR. Narrative reviews, commentaries, and editorials without patient data were not considered eligible for inclusion.",
      "reason": "The manuscript specifies eligible study designs and that case reports were eligible and narrative reviews/commentaries were excluded (study-design characteristics). Inclusion criteria for the population/intervention are also stated (text_6). However, other study-eligibility characteristics (e.g., explicit follow-up requirements or detailed setting constraints) are not described in the provided evidence, so the reporting is incomplete."
